                <pb facs="0484" n="402" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg402"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/751.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Mexican Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <p>On the 4th instant the Mexican Embassy informed the Department of State of the
                    receipt of a telegram [etc.].</p>
                <pb facs="0485" n="403" xml:id="pg403"/>
                <p>The Secretary of State has taken pleasure in sending copies of the memorandum of
                    the Mexican Embassy to the Attorney General and the Secretary of War for
                    appropriate action.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of
                            State</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-02-06"><hi rendition="#italic">February 6, 1911</hi></date>.
                    </dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
